      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 252]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Holidays)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My country has many traditional holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "There are Lunar New Year’s, Independence Day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Buddha’s Birthday, Chu-seok and many more."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Lunar New Year’s is the first big holiday celebrated of the year."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Perhaps the biggest national holiday of the year is Chu-seok"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "or what is also referred to as Korean Thanksgiving Day."
    },
